{"__dsh_paper":"ir-container-v1","entries":[{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-P0","scope_ref":"P1","token":"p_0","meaning":"供应商声称的次品率标称值","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-N","scope_ref":"P1","token":"N","meaning":"批量大小","unit":"件","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-N1","scope_ref":"P1","token":"n","meaning":"抽样样本量","unit":"件","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-X","scope_ref":"P1","token":"X","meaning":"检出不合格件数","unit":"件","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-P","scope_ref":"P1","token":"p","meaning":"真实次品率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-C","scope_ref":"P1","token":"c","meaning":"拒收临界值（检出不合格件数下限）","unit":"件","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-CP","scope_ref":"P1","token":"c'","meaning":"接收临界值（检出不合格件数上限）","unit":"件","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-ALPHA","scope_ref":"P1","token":"alpha","meaning":"第一类错误概率（拒收判据信度补）","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-D1","scope_ref":"P1","token":"d_1","meaning":"零配件1是否检测","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"BOOLEAN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-D2","scope_ref":"P1","token":"d_2","meaning":"零配件2是否检测","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"BOOLEAN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-D3","scope_ref":"P1","token":"d_3","meaning":"成品是否检测","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"BOOLEAN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-D4","scope_ref":"P1","token":"d_4","meaning":"不合格成品是否拆解","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"BOOLEAN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-D5","scope_ref":"P1","token":"d_5","meaning":"退货不合格品是否拆解回用","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"BOOLEAN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-Q1","scope_ref":"P1","token":"q_1","meaning":"进入装配的零配件1实际次品率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-Q2","scope_ref":"P1","token":"q_2","meaning":"进入装配的零配件2实际次品率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PASS","scope_ref":"P1","token":"p_装配","meaning":"装配次品率（两零配件均合格时装配后仍不合格的概率）","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PDEF","scope_ref":"P1","token":"P_def","meaning":"成品不合格率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-POK","scope_ref":"P1","token":"P_ok","meaning":"成品合格率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PI","scope_ref":"P1","token":"pi","meaning":"单件成品期望净利","unit":"元","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"REAL","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-CV","scope_ref":"P1","token":"C_v","meaning":"节点v产出一件合格品的期望成本","unit":"元","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_REAL","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-RV","scope_ref":"P1","token":"R_v","meaning":"节点v的合格率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-RI","scope_ref":"P1","token":"r_i","meaning":"零配件i的合格率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PU","scope_ref":"P1","token":"p_U","meaning":"次品率单侧置信上限","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PHAT","scope_ref":"P1","token":"p_hat","meaning":"次品率抽样估计值","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-M","scope_ref":"P1","token":"m","meaning":"工序数","unit":"道","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-NN","scope_ref":"P1","token":"n","meaning":"零配件个数（问题3）","unit":"个","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-BATCH-LARGE","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"批量 N 足够大（或采用有放回/二项近似），抽样结果 X ~ B(n, p)，X 为检出不合格件数，p 为真实次品率。","source_type":"APPROXIMATION","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"批量 N 足够大（或采用有放回/二项近似），抽样结果 X ~ B(n, p)，X 为检出不合格件数，p 为真实次品率。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-EXACT-TEST","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"采用二项分布精确检验（而非正态近似），因为标称值 10% 属小概率、样本量不大时正态近似误差显著。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"采用二项分布精确检验（而非正态近似），因为标称值 10% 属小概率、样本量不大时正态近似误差显著。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-NO-COST-CONSTRAINT-Q1","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"问题 1 只要求"检测次数尽可能少"，检测费用在问题 1 中不参与优化（问题 2、4 中才计入成本）。","source_type":"GIVEN","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"问题 1 只要求"检测次数尽可能少"，检测费用在问题 1 中不参与优化（问题 2、4 中才计入成本）。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-LTPD","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"情形(2) 需要一个对立的次品率参照 p₁ 才能定义"90% 信度认定 p ≤ 0.10"。合理解读为：在 p = 0.10 处，P(X ≤ c' | p=0.10) ≥ 0.90，即"接收"这一判断在 p 恰为标称值时有 ≥90% 的把握；等价于单侧 90% 置信上限 ≤ 0.10。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"情形(2) 需要一个对立的次品率参照 p₁ 才能定义"90% 信度认定 p ≤ 0.10"。合理解读为：在 p = 0.10 处，P(X ≤ c' | p=0.10) ≥ 0.90，即"接收"这一判断在 p 恰为标称值时有 ≥90% 的把握；等价于单侧 90% 置信上限 ≤ 0.10。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INDEPENDENCE","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"零配件 1、2 次品率独立；成品次品率（装配次品率）指"两零配件均合格时装配后仍不合格"的概率，与零配件次品独立。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"零配件 1、2 次品率独立；成品次品率（装配次品率）指"两零配件均合格时装配后仍不合格"的概率，与零配件次品独立。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-DETECT-PERFECT","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"检测完全可靠（无漏检/误检），检测出的不合格件直接丢弃。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"检测完全可靠（无漏检/误检），检测出的不合格件直接丢弃。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-DISASSEMBLE-RECOVER","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"拆解不损坏零配件，拆解后两零配件可回用；拆解费用按件计。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"拆解不损坏零配件，拆解后两零配件可回用；拆解费用按件计。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-STEADY-STATE","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"拆解回用与退货调换形成稳态循环，用期望值（几何级数）处理"重复步骤"。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"拆解回用与退货调换形成稳态循环，用期望值（几何级数）处理"重复步骤"。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-MARKET-RETURN","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"用户退回的不合格品，企业无条件调换：损失 = 调换损失（表给）+ 重发一件成品的成本（题目注明"除调换次品之外"，故调换损失不含替换品本身成本，需另行计入）。","source_type":"DERIVED","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"用户退回的不合格品，企业无条件调换：损失 = 调换损失（表给）+ 重发一件成品的成本（题目注明"除调换次品之外"，故调换损失不含替换品本身成本，需另行计入）。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-SEMI-DETECT","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"半成品检测同样完全可靠；半成品不合格的原因是其组成零配件不合格或半成品装配次品（10%）；半成品次品率 10% 指"零配件全合格时装配后仍不合格"。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"半成品检测同样完全可靠；半成品不合格的原因是其组成零配件不合格或半成品装配次品（10%）；半成品次品率 10% 指"零配件全合格时装配后仍不合格"。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-TREE-STRUCTURE","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"装配结构为树状（每个半成品/成品由确定的子件集合装配），无共享子件、无循环（除拆解回用）。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"装配结构为树状（每个半成品/成品由确定的子件集合装配），无共享子件、无循环（除拆解回用）。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-RECURSIVE-DECISION","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"决策具有最优子结构：给定"进入某工序的子件合格率"，该工序及下游的最优决策与上游如何实现无关（无后效性），可用动态规划/递归求解。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"决策具有最优子结构：给定"进入某工序的子件合格率"，该工序及下游的最优决策与上游如何实现无关（无后效性），可用动态规划/递归求解。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-SAMPLE-SIZE-Q4","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"需设定每个零配件/半成品/成品的抽样样本量。合理设定：按问题 1 的方案，对每个零配件抽 n 件（如 n=29 或 68），检出不合格件数 x，得 p̂ = x/n 与置信区间。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"需设定每个零配件/半成品/成品的抽样样本量。合理设定：按问题 1 的方案，对每个零配件抽 n 件（如 n=29 或 68），检出不合格件数 x，得 p̂ = x/n 与置信区间。"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-ROBUST-DECISION","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"决策准则取两种：(a) 保守准则——用次品率的置信上限做决策（风险厌恶）；(b) 期望准则——用后验均值（如 Jeffreys 后验均值 (x+0.5)/(n+1)）做决策。两者都给出，比较差异。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"决策准则取两种：(a) 保守准则——用次品率的置信上限做决策（风险厌恶）；(b) 期望准则——用后验均值（如 Jeffreys 后验均值 (x+0.5)/(n+1)）做决策。两者都给出，比较差异。"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-REJECT-CRIT","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X >= c | p = p0) <= alpha","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-X"],"rhs_symbols":["S-C","S-P0","S-ALPHA"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"情形 (1) 拒收判据：在 95% 信度下认定 p > 0.10，即要求在 p = 0.10 处，检出 X ≥ c 的概率 ≤ 0.05（控制第一类错误 α = 0.05）。求最小的 n 及对应临界值 c，使 P(X ≥ c | p=0.10) ≤ 0.05。","e1_span":"情形 (1) 拒收判据：在 95% 信度下认定 p > 0.10，即要求在 p = 0.10 处，检出 X ≥ c 的概率 ≤ 0.05（控制第一类错误 α = 0.05）。求最小的 n 及对应临界值 c，使 P(X ≥ c | p=0.10) ≤ 0.05。"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-ACCEPT-CRIT","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X <= cprime | p = p0) >= 0.90","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-X"],"rhs_symbols":["S-CP","S-P0"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"在 p = 0.10 处，P(X ≤ c' | p=0.10) ≥ 0.90，即"接收"这一判断在 p 恰为标称值时有 ≥90% 的把握","e1_span":"在 p = 0.10 处，P(X ≤ c' | p=0.10) ≥ 0.90，即"接收"这一判断在 p 恰为标称值时有 ≥90% 的把握"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-PDEF","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P_def = 1 - (1-q1)*(1-q2)*(1-p_ass)","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-PDEF"],"rhs_symbols":["S-Q1","S-Q2","S-PASS"],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"成品不合格率 P_def = 1 - (1-q₁)(1-q₂)(1-p_装配)","e1_span":"成品不合格率 P_def = 1 - (1-q₁)(1-q₂)(1-p_装配) = q₁ + q₂ - q₁q₂ + (1-q₁)(1-q₂)·p_装配"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-POK","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P_ok = (1-q1)*(1-q2)*(1-p_ass)","representation":